<p>High lipid solubility; CNS distribution</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Central suppression of ocular motor nuclei</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
